- `in_progress` - Task is being worked on
- `completed` - Task is complete
- `cancelled` - Task has been cancelled

## Task Priority Options
- `low` - Low priority
- `medium` - Medium priority
- `high` - High priority
- `urgent` - Urgent/critical priority

